All physical links are UP, all OSPF sessions are healthy, and EIGRP within the cloud is working. The sole failure point is R11's FRR configuration: it learns pc12's subnet (120.0.0.0/8) via EIGRP but never redistributes those EIGRP prefixes into OSPF, leaving the entire OSPF backbone without a route back to the EIGRP cloud.

